s in the question corner where all  the answers his readers questions in  between chapters in the one piece  volumes to make a long story short he is  unapologetic when it comes to fanservice  in one piece and he feels that any  healthy boy or man should not be scolded  or made to feel ashamed for his interest  in the female body as a result the  female characters in one piece are not  afraid to show some skin especially the  28 year-old Nico Robin for kids however  thought different so they added clothing  and removed any cleavage number 6 no  Christianity for some reason for kids  felt like they had to remove anything  even vaguely reminiscent of Christianity  so devil fruit became cursive fruit kind  of like how Satan from Dragon Ball Z he  became Hercule however some of this  censorship definitely goes too far for  instance I guess for kids that the logs  that Zorro is tied to in the Marine base  to closely resemble a cross and so the  top of the log was removed mihawk sword  and dagger were also changed for the  same reason how  ever what is perhaps the weirdest change  is how they changed miss merry  Christmas's name to miss Groundhog's Day  and recolored her Christmas tree necktie  to be purple and red I guess we should  just consider ourselves lucky that  didn't turn chopper 2 blue nose reindeer  into a groundhog as well  number 7 no real guns probably some of  the most bizarre instances of censorship  revolved around guns one piece is a  world filled with pirates in Pirates  have guns the Marines have guns to stop  the pirates who have guns  my point is guns are prevalent in one  piece and their presence makes for some  of the most intense moments in the  entire show  so how did four kids go about dealing  with this one well in many cases let's  just say their censorship backfired in  the process of censoring the guns they  robbed significant moments of their  intensity and sometimes the result was  downright comedic let's start by  comparing the Marines fo